WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit with legs extended.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Hinge forward and let the spine round softly.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Rest the hands wherever they land.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Soften the jaw and forehead.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Rise slowly after the hold.
